{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876320/extras/657905d579470147ee4c15c1a66040a1.avif?t=1755791668\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feathers? Who needs 'em.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Plucked Pack is raw, unapologetic confidence. It\u2019s for those who\u2019ve seen too much, lost it all in the shower room, and came out shinier \u2014 and weirder \u2014 than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this pack you'll get access to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featherless Skin</strong>: Pale, patchy, and proud. Nothing to hide, nowhere to hide it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shower Towel Hat</strong>: A stylish wrap for eggs who just got out\u2026 or just gave up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toothbrush</strong>: Just a toothbrush. Totally normal. Definitely not suspicious. Don\u2019t ask.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: May cause increased breeze sensitivity and awkward stares in the yard.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876320?t=1755791668","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876320?t=1755791668","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876320/299e1c13e8f3a448fee428a6f2764a9e8bfdbe86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755791668","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876320/299e1c13e8f3a448fee428a6f2764a9e8bfdbe86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755791668","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description